  "details": "At some angles, lenticular stickers render completely differently in each eye, leading to eye strain. I appreciate this is sorta \"realistic\", and maybe this is being exacerbated by using a wide FOV headset, but I must say it was annoying to have this sticker in my view at this angle.\n\nThe easiest way I can demonstrate this issue is showing a screenshot of the SteamVR VR view, which is attached.\n\nPerhaps the lenticular effect could be calculated based on the center point of the two eyes instead of being done for each eye separately.",
